abstract: >-
  A curated, annotated list of resources for multi-agent systems (MAS)
  research and engineering — spanning classical coordination theory,
  game theory and negotiation, multi-agent reinforcement learning (MARL),
  LLM-based agent teams, benchmarks, frameworks, and agent
  interoperability protocols (MCP, A2A).
